#. English: Dustmon
msgid "boss_dustmon.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: The sovereign ruler of dust. Adds dust minions in the player's gacha machines, feasts on fallen allies, grows when dust minions merge, and gains power from all dust in existence.
msgid "boss_dustmon.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Toughmon
msgid "boss_toughmon.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: The armored bastion commander. Hardens itself with armor from living allies and commands frontline troops with armor and spikes.
msgid "boss_toughmon.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Doppelkun
msgid "boss_doppelkun.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: The elusive mirror entity. Reflects the true strength of the opposing Hero upon entering battle.
msgid "boss_doppelkun.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Slimeblob
msgid "elite_slimeblob.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: [color=#ffd166][b]When Taking Damage[/b][/color], if it is not knocked out, summons a Level 1 Spikeslime into the first empty slot.
msgid "elite_slimeblob.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Burnie
msgid "elite_burnie.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: A raging flame elemental. Deals bonus damage equal to target's Burn stacks and ignites battlefield slots.
msgid "elite_burnie.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Spikeslime
msgid "unit_spikeslime.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: A spiky slime minion. Enters battle bristling with sharp thorns.
msgid "unit_spikeslime.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Banner: Lone Whale
msgid "trinket.banner_lone_whale.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Deploys a single colossal Soliwhale in Slot 0 with massive stats, drawing immense power from empty allied slots. Reinforcements are completely disabled.
msgid "trinket.banner_lone_whale.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Banner: Swarm
msgid "trinket.banner_swarm.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Floods all lineup slots with inexpensive units, prioritizing maximum board saturation over raw tiers. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in wave reinforcements to replenish any fallen ranks.
msgid "trinket.banner_swarm.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Fire Banner
msgid "trinket.banner_fire_phalanx.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: An aggressive frontline anchored by Fire and Mecha synergies, spreading Burn and retaliating on hit. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, summons Fire reinforcements and tactical allies equipped with Fire Emblems.
msgid "trinket.banner_fire_phalanx.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Banner: Dustmon
msgid "trinket.banner_dustmon.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Dustmon commands from the backline while waves of reinforcements fill the front ranks, triggering its resonance and stat growth each time an ally is knocked out. Summons reinforcements at the end of each odd-numbered turn.
msgid "trinket.banner_dustmon.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Banner: Toughmon
msgid "trinket.banner_toughmon.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Toughmon fortifies the backline behind an impenetrable phalanx of heavy Tanks equipped with defensive gear, sharing innate Tank trait synergies. Summons heavy Tank reinforcements at the end of each odd-numbered turn.
msgid "trinket.banner_toughmon.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Banner: Doppelkun
msgid "trinket.banner_doppelkun.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Doppelkun leads from the front, flanked exclusively by shape-shifting Mimicloaks that mirror opposing player units at the start of each turn. Summons replacement Mimicloaks at the end of each odd-numbered turn.
msgid "trinket.banner_doppelkun.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Banner: Slimeblob
msgid "trinket.banner_slimeblob.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Slimeblob's gelatinous banner. At the start of each turn, summons a Level 1 Spikeslime into the first empty slot. If all slots are full, levels up the first non-max Spikeslime from front to back. If all Spikeslimes are max level, heals the front Spikeslime for 3 HP and grants it +2 Spikes.
msgid "trinket.banner_slimeblob.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Banner: Burnie
msgid "trinket.banner_burnie.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Burnie's blazing vanguard. Grants the Fire Trait Crest for free, surrounding Burnie with synergized Fire units that spread Burn and explode when knocked out. Summons Fire reinforcements at the end of each odd-numbered turn.
msgid "trinket.banner_burnie.desc"
msgstr ""

